WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.869
-Police in Louisiana arrested
a man after he went swimming

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:05.404
in the aquarium
at a Bass Pro Shops.

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:06.872
Employees said
they would have gotten him out

00:00:06.872 --> 00:00:08.675
if there were only
some fishing gear nearby.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.976
[ Laughter ]

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.877
-Jimmy, Jimmy, Jimmy,
come on, James, Jimmy.

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:13.680
-Whoa!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.281
Michael Che!
-Jimmy.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.983
-Michael Che is here!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.617
What?!

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.054
-Jimmy, Jim, Jamantha.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:22.255
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:25.124
A guy swimming
in a Bass Pro Shops aquarium,

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:27.159
and that's the best you can do?

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:29.929
-What, you think
you can do better?

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.365
-You're damn right we can.
-Oh, oh, my gosh!

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:35.434
Colin Jost!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:37.937
Colin Jost? You too?

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.338
Well, you know what this means.

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:40.707
It's time for
a good old-fashioned

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.208
"Tonight Show" jokeoff!

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:46.979
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:49.949
Alright, I think
we all know the rules,

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.484
but I'll repeat the setup.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:54.320
Police in Louisiana arrested
a man after he went swimming

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.489
in the aquarium
at a Bass Pro Shops.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.524
And go!

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:00.226
-Beep-beep-beep.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:03.262
Weirdly, he was charged with
being too sober

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:04.931
for a guy at a Bass Pro Shops.

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.499
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:07.867
-[ Trills tongue ]

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:10.737
Even worse, he wore his
face mask as a banana hammock.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.005
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:14.473
-[ Mimics buzzer ] The guy
wasn't in jail very long.

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:16.342
It was more of
a catch and release.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.444
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:22.348
-Boop, beep, boop.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.183
So, move over, "Up."

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:28.154
"Bass Pro Shops Aquarium"
is now the saddest Pixar film.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:31.190
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.760
-[ Trills tongue ]
Meanwhile Sea World was like,

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.461
"For 50 bucks,
you can do whatever."

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:37.130
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:40.166
-Bahm! They were able to catch
him by baiting the hook

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.534
with a little bit more crack.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.402
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:45.805 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:48.440
-Alright, it is time
for round two.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.675
Here's the next story.

00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:52.645
A 94-year-old Virginia man
received permission

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.880
from Wrigley's to be buried
in a casket

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.517
shaped like a giant pack of
Juicy Fruit.

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:59.352
Go!
-Beep.

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.320
The man plans to be buried on

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.523
the underside
of a middle school desk.

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:04.791
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:07.794
-Bahm! Permission? What are
they gonna do, kill him?

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:09.429
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:11.397
-[ Trills tongue ]

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.533
At first the man's family
loved the idea,

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.435
but then quickly
realized it was tasteless.

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.569
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.569 --> 00:02:18.871
-Beep and beep.

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:21.841
Right now there's a carpenter
taking measurements

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.209
with a roll of Bubble Tape.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.344
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:25.577
-Beep!

00:02:25.577 --> 00:02:27.947
So in 1,000 years,
archaeologists will still wonder

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:30.617
what the hell is the fruit
flavor is supposed to be?

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:31.784
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:33.319
-Beep!

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:37.090
And here to read the eulogy off
a giant wrapper is Bazooka Joe.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.291
[ Dinging ]

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.893 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:42.828
Alright, final round.

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:44.030
Here's the last story.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:46.866
After 43 years,
Chuck E. Cheese announced

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:49.402
they've filed for
Chapter 11 bankruptcy.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:51.371
Go!
-Beep!

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:53.506
So -- [ Laughs ]

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.041
I started with
way too much beep.

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:56.942
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.942 --> 00:02:58.744
-You came in hot, man.
-Alright, I'll back it off.

00:02:58.744 --> 00:03:01.213
-Came in hot with the beeps.
-So.

00:03:01.213 --> 00:03:03.082
-No, it doesn't say "so."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:04.817
-Sorry. Beep!
-Yes.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:08.087
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:11.257
-Wow, so there might be some
flaws in the business model

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:13.559
of a rat who sells pizza
to children.

00:03:13.559 --> 00:03:16.362
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:19.332
-So.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:21.333
Okay, but before you close,

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:23.469
I think my kid is still
in your ball pit somewhere.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:24.637
[ Laughter ]
Sorry.

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:28.307
-Whahm! Which I think means
that in 2024,

00:03:28.307 --> 00:03:30.777
Chuck E. Cheese will be
President of the United States.

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:34.513
[ Dinging ]
-Ah, there you go right there!

00:03:34.513 --> 00:03:37.416
That was "Jokeoff!"

00:03:37.416 --> 00:03:39.485
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:42.422
Give it up for Colin Jost,
Michael Che, everybody!

